 we have the ability to  you're on a raft kind of looking up from  here you see the dam and it's really in  its glory so what we started with about  30 almost 40 years ago is what we call a  regular run starts here at the base of  hoover dam travels 11 miles down to  willow beach it's a one-way smooth water  fully narrated motor assisted raft trip  and for adults it's 140 and for kids  it's 110. so  kids are five to fifteen so kids four  and under are free if you're a little  short on time  then we we created what's called a  postcard tour which gives you a snapshot  of hoover dam and you start here again  and we  go up about a mile and a half down river  it's fully narrated again it's about an  hour and a half and it starts and ends  here there are several different tours  you can embark on all showing you  close-up views of what the colorado  river has to offer and the guys that  took measurements did so manually up  above and a little bit to the right you  can see an old hand crank well i'm  really sad it's over but that's a wrap  thank you to kathleen for being the best  tour guide you guys have to check this  out it's the best day ever and i got a  good tan while i was out here see you  guys later  to book a tour you can visit
 

